    {
      "id": "17967491130400326",
      "text": "Nenek aku selalu bilang — kalau udah ga bisa ngapa-ngapain, diam dulu. Dzikir dulu. Biarkan Allah yang gerakin.\nDulu aku",
      "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@_iame.hijrah/post/DeHlwB2kXl2",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-05T16:01:37+0000",
